('velvetfire','VelvetFire','Multimedia','In development','Voice, intimacy, and imagination','An experimental voice-led project exploring intimacy, sovereignty, and the possibilities of storytelling across media.','velvet'),
('love-and-hope','Messages of Love & Hope','Philosophy & Essays','Ongoing writing','A little more light in the world','Short reflections in good cheer, human possibility, compassion, and the ordinary ways we can make life gentler for one another. Follow the author’s public writing on Substack.','rye'),
